  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoration of the Mid-18th-Century Santa Teresa Church in Cochabamba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One of the first convent churches in Cochabamba and the only one built in the Baroque style, the building is susceptible to damage from water infiltration and a structurally compromised roof. This project includes structural stabilization and other remedial preservation measures to keep the building dry and safe.</narrative>
  </description>
